 "id": "395930933087914", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974482_395930936421247_7140068988406810268_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5wagNy6BE3EQ7kNvwFZxBCz&_nc_oc=AdqvKooubbd4OxeXjCCE3zMR5oL9nqlqVH5QEV6Uv9TBVYmmAAmEln1L_BmEMcsWL0Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA13EHBvpPKH8UGWlycTdqrc5CZd54MuVl5L-N0G3z34A&oe=6A69FC92"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "1468529877063199", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031579_1468529880396532_4535593032672982803_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zVbV4ONSflMQ7kNvwGbiJI2&_nc_oc=AdoFS9mnzgPCMyk1YzccGFolokjA28ejRCTy-WEnClJ5DTfgAUXvhJi8cOctEWgE69E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD8PAm6KzcS-UdAIdd6REZOaRAu3tO35LX1hECT9Fh0AQ&oe=6A6A0AE4"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot1.png", "id": "3339700806176271", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982675_3339700809509604_1988799250975639629_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BY7uwHy8jmIQ7kNvwEKCUne&_nc_oc=AdqufCROXNwHldxgeXBAp1TmI0N8wYrHm4Kuoy3cWjMLpE15-aoAtNETOlsEatowF1Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB1Tyn99saPSmnNLa-9W6_mGLVFAyP4VaNExnkx2qLO9Q&oe=6A69E591"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer cover.png", "id": "224857767260795", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982528_224857770594128_2396860306280612700_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E_QohFvSt90Q7kNvwFytLas&_nc_oc=Adp4uDhn6gjg6Bjaz8K4n8yzYK9RjwrJT0Rk7y43jCCySR31J1dzYdSVL4Ejaxug2_s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAltCwQNyQpA77gEph6SFOQoAqi3su_hMw-iD5dGhuNfg&oe=6A6A037F"}, "display_name": "Detective Winston Wayne", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Think with your hands and craft your way out of every challenge thrown at you by late Duke Hill.\n\nDelve into an untold alternative history set between two world wars, where a war veteran turned seasoned detective finds himself thrust into an unprecedented case. The demise of a close friend is merely the tip of the iceberg, as a vast conspiracy looms on the horizon, challenging the resolve of our determined detective.\n\nSome of the main features you'll find in Detective Winston Wayne: \n* New generation of escape room puzzles \n* Immerse yourself in Duke Hill's mesmerizing mansion \n* Realistic graphics on stand-alone Quest family devices\n* An alternative history connecting World Wars\n* Live through an ethical dilemma and navigate through several possible endings\n\nDebut Game from Vancouver-based indie studio, SomniumPorta.\nStay Tuned and follow us on the store for more updates on Detective Winston Wayne.", "short_description": "Step into Winston Wayne's shoes, a detective investigating the mysterious suicide of his long-time friend, Duke Henry Hill. Dive into the immersive escape room experience and uncover the truth in a world tainted by blind loyalty and conspiracies. Explore diverse locations and crack the most personal case of Winston Wayne's career. The burning question: Are you prepared to Dance With The Devil Himself?"}]}, "developer_name": "SomniumPorta VR development", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://somniumporta.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SomniumPorta", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.somniumporta.com/game", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_